    questionText: "(a) Select your preferred site A or B, and give two reasons for your choice. (b) Draw a large freehand sketch of your chosen site. On your sketch include your preferred: house position; entrance to the site; driveway to the house. (c) Give one advantage and one disadvantage of building a house in the countryside.",
    tariffModel: {"kind":"fixed"}, totalMarks: 50,
