    stem: "A draft design for an attic conversion to include a bedroom with an en suite bathroom is shown. The position of the stairs, en suite bathroom, and a door to the bedroom are included.",
    questionText: "(a) Discuss two advantages of converting an attic space into a bedroom. (b) Draw a large freehand sketch of the given design and show your preferred location for each of the following in the attic bedroom: access to en suite; double bed; clothes storage unit; study space. Give one reason for selecting each location. (c) Specify a suitable floor covering for the bedroom and give two reasons for your choice.",
    tariffModel: {"kind":"fixed"}, totalMarks: 50,
    rows: [
    { id: "a-advantage-1", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Advantage 1", marks: 5, contextNote: "Such as: a cost-effective way of adding living space; an extra bedroom; increases the value of the home.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5] },
    { id: "a-advantage-2", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Advantage 2", marks: 5, contextNote: "A second, different advantage. Such as: versatility for other uses; no need to extend the house; better sound separation from living spaces; the chance to insulate the roof to a higher standard.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5] },
    { id: "b-sketch", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Sketch", marks: 8, contextNote: "A large freehand sketch of the given attic design.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8] },
    { id: "b-access", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Location and valid reason for access to en suite (3 + 2 marks)", marks: 5, contextNote: "Location 3 and reason 2. Such as: beside the shower, giving more room inside the en suite and more bedroom wall space, or opposite the sink for privacy from the bed.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5] },
    { id: "b-bed", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Location and valid reason for double bed (3 + 2 marks)", marks: 5, contextNote: "Location 3 and reason 2. Such as: against a wall with room for bedside tables, near sockets and the light switch, away from the eaves for head height.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5] },
    { id: "b-storage", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Location and valid reason for clothes storage unit (3 + 2 marks)", marks: 5, contextNote: "Location 3 and reason 2. Such as: against a wall to leave space around the bed and fix the unit securely, or in an alcove to use underused space.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5] },
    { id: "b-study", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Location and valid reason for study space (3 + 2 marks)", marks: 5, contextNote: "Location 3 and reason 2. Such as: away from the bed as a separate zone, out of the corner for good light, or in an alcove.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5] },
    { id: "c-covering", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Suitable floor covering", marks: 4, contextNote: "Such as: carpet, wood laminate, vinyl, solid wood or linoleum.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4] },
    { id: "c-reason-1", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Reason 1", marks: 4, contextNote: "A reason matching the covering. Such as, carpet: comfortable and absorbs sound; laminate: durable and less expensive.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4] },
    { id: "c-reason-2", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Reason 2", marks: 4, contextNote: "A second, different reason. Such as, vinyl: easy to install and water resistant; solid wood: attractive and can be sanded and refinished; linoleum: hardwearing and waterproof.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4] },
    ],
