    id: "cons-2023-ol-q1-complete", topicId: "cons-1-5", conceptId: "first-floor-wall-section-complete",
    section: "B", questionRef: "2023 OL Q1 — complete",
    stem: "The sketch shows the external wall and timber first floor of a dwelling house. The external wall is a 400 mm concrete block wall with a full-fill insulated cavity. The wall is plastered on both sides. The first floor joists are 225 mm × 50 mm and are fixed to the external wall using joist hangers. The floor is finished with a tongued and grooved hardwood floor, on 20 mm plywood decking with a plasterboard ceiling beneath.",
    questionText: "(a) To a scale of 1:5, draw a vertical section through the external wall and first floor. On your drawing show the typical construction details from a level 400 mm below the plasterboard ceiling to a level 400 mm above the hardwood floor. Show an internal floor width of 900 mm. Include four typical dimensions. (b) On your drawing, show the typical design detailing to connect the inner and outer leaves of the external wall.",
    tariffModel: {"kind":"fixed"}, totalMarks: 50,
    rows: [
    { id: "a-details", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Any 7 x 5 marks", marks: 35, contextNote: "Credit the best SEVEN acceptable details at 5 marks each, capped at 35. Marked details: concrete block outer leaf with render; full-fill cavity with wall tie; concrete block inner leaf with internal plaster; joist hanger; joist; airtight tape; plasterboard; plywood decking; tongue and groove flooring; skirting board. The model specifies 19 mm render, 100 mm leaves, a 200 mm full-fill cavity, 15 mm plaster, 225 × 50 mm joists and 20 mm plywood decking.", permittedMarks: [0,5,10,15,20,25,30,35] },
    { id: "a-dimensions", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Any 4 typical dimensions", marks: 4, contextNote: "Four appropriate typical dimensions on the section.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4] },
    { id: "a-presentation", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Draughting, accuracy and scale (excellent, good, fair)", marks: 8, contextNote: "Draughting, accuracy and scale of the section: excellent 8, good 6, fair 4.", permittedMarks: [0,4,6,8] },
    { id: "b-wall-tie", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Wall tie clearly identified", marks: 3, contextNote: "Show and identify the wall tie connecting the two leaves across the cavity, as in the scheme’s model section.", permittedMarks: [0,3] },
    ],
