    stem: "The draft design for a utility room in a new dwelling house is shown. The positions of the external door, window and a door to the kitchen are included.",
    questionText: "(a) Discuss two advantages of including a large utility room in the design of a new home. (b) Draw a large freehand sketch of the given design and show your preferred location for each of the following in the utility room: sink; washing machine; storage units; seating / boot area. Give one reason for selecting each location. (c) Specify a suitable floor covering for the utility room and give two reasons for your choice.",
    tariffModel: {"kind":"fixed"}, totalMarks: 50,
    rows: [
    { id: "a-advantage-1", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Advantage 1", marks: 5, contextNote: "Such as: extra usable kitchen space; a place to store outdoor shoes and clothing, keeping the house hygienic.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5] },
    { id: "a-advantage-2", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Advantage 2", marks: 5, contextNote: "A second, different advantage. Such as: the washing machine away from the kitchen to reduce noise; storage for bulky items; a secure space for a pet; space to hang and air washed clothes.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5] },
    { id: "b-sketch", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Sketch", marks: 8, contextNote: "A large freehand sketch of the given utility room design.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8] },
    { id: "b-sink", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Location and valid reason for sink (3 + 2 marks)", marks: 5, contextNote: "Location 3 and reason 2. Such as: by the window for natural light and a view out; on an external wall for the wastewater connection.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5] },
    { id: "b-washing-machine", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Location and valid reason for washing machine (3 + 2 marks)", marks: 5, contextNote: "Location 3 and reason 2. Such as: on an external wall for wastewater disposal and water supply; near electrical sockets.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5] },
    { id: "b-storage", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Location and valid reason for storage units (3 + 2 marks)", marks: 5, contextNote: "Location 3 and reason 2. Such as: against a wall so they do not block the doors and can be fixed securely; beside the washing machine for laundry and detergents.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5] },
    { id: "b-seating", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Location and valid reason for seating / boot area (3 + 2 marks)", marks: 5, contextNote: "Location 3 and reason 2. Such as: against a wall so it can be fixed securely; close to the external door for removing and storing shoes and boots.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4,5] },
    { id: "c-covering", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Suitable floor covering", marks: 4, contextNote: "Such as: ceramic tiles, vinyl, polished concrete, wood laminate or linoleum.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4] },
    { id: "c-reason-1", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Reason 1", marks: 4, contextNote: "A reason matching the covering. Such as, ceramic tiles: hard wearing, resistant to water damage, easy to maintain; vinyl: easy to install, water resistant.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4] },
    { id: "c-reason-2", kind: "criterion", verbatim: "Reason 2", marks: 4, contextNote: "A second, different reason. Such as, polished concrete: transfers underfloor heating well, highly durable; wood laminate: durable and less expensive; linoleum: hardwearing and waterproof.", permittedMarks: [0,1,2,3,4] },
    ],
    taskGroups: [{"sourceCardId":"cons-2023-ol-q7-a","label":"a","marks":10,"rowIds":["a-advantage-1","a-advantage-2"]},{"sourceCardId":"cons-2023-ol-q7-b","label":"b","marks":28,"rowIds":["b-sketch","b-sink","b-washing-machine","b-storage","b-seating"]},{"sourceCardId":"cons-2023-ol-q7-c","label":"c","marks":12,"rowIds":["c-covering","c-reason-1","c-reason-2"]}],
