    stem: "It is proposed to collect rainwater from the roof of a house and to store it in an underground tank as shown.",
    questionText: "(a) Draw the given sketch and show the pipework necessary to collect the rainwater from the roof and to convey it to the underground storage tank. Label the main components and give their typical sizes. (b) The stored rainwater is used for flushing a toilet. Show, using notes and freehand sketches, the pipework and pump necessary to take the water from the underground tank to a storage tank in the attic. Show also how to connect the toilet cistern to the storage tank in the attic. Include the necessary valves. (c) Discuss one advantage of storing rainwater in an underground tank.",
